%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: collegequest3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749487
    - rid: 4351267988772749489
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes, Sayori?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Why did Tolfdir stay behind in that room again?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749490
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, he said the coffins deserved closer inspection.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749491
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749492
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: He's a nice old man... but he's not a very good teacher, is he?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749493
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Personally, I would not send any of <i>my</i> potential students into
      danger, especially not ahead of me...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749494
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm beginning to think {mc} didn't emphasize the absolute incompetence
      of the college leadership enough...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749495
    - rid: 4351267988772749496
    - rid: 4351267988772749497
    - rid: 4351267988772749498
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh my goodness, {mc} heard us talking about him!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: We're sorry, {mc}!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749499
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not sure if you guys can hear this, but...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749500
    - rid: 4351267988772749501
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If you see one of those word walls, like the one I stared at back before
      I got a concussion at Bleak Falls Barrow-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Could you write down what they say? From left to right, then top to bottom,
      like how you usually read.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Also, let's meet up in Riverwood in... uh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You know what, if you can hear this, I'll just yell out when we should
      meet up. Send a letter if you can't make it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... so, assuming they heard me, how do I stop thi-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749502
    - rid: 4351267988772749503
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess {mc} figured out how to-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749504
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749505
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: How'd he put it again?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749506
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, judging by the thunderous echo that was similar to when the Graybeards
      called for {mc}...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749507
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: He must've used the Thu'um to project his voice in a similar manner.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749508
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Cool!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749509
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Indeed.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749510
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351267988772749511
    - rid: 4351268012365971507
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I am just <i>sick</i> of all these draugr!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268012365971508
    - rid: 4351268012365971509
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm beginning to think that not a single Nordic tomb is safe...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268012365971510
    - rid: 4351268012365971511
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268012365971512
    - rid: 4351268012365971534
    - rid: 4351268012365971535
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268012365971536
    - rid: 4351268038788775936
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh look, Yuri!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788775937
    - rid: 4351268038788775992
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: It's some of those spinning animal pillars!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788775993
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri looks toward the end of the hallway, noticing the lever and the
      lowered gate.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: They'll probably open that gate.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788775994
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, uh, where's the animals we have to match them with?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788775995
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, {mc} said that these puzzles were usually very easy, so they shouldn't
      be far.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788775996
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: After a few seconds of careful searching, the two have found the animals
      they were searching for.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788775997
    - rid: 4351268038788775998
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, they're just right behind the pillars, ehehe...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788775999
    - rid: 4351268038788776000
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: How'd {mc} do this again?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776001
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori tries to twist one of the pillars like {mc} did, but doesn't find
      much success.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776002
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Phew-! Yuri, could you give me a hand with this?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776003
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With their powers combined, they are finally able to twist the pillars.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776004
    - rid: 4351268038788776005
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori and Yuri twist every pillar into the correct position, then pull
      the lever which opens the gate.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776006
    - rid: 4351268038788776007
    - rid: 4351268038788776008
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey Yuri, do you think that the other students are doing something as
      dangerous as us?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776009
    - rid: 4351268038788776010
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I doubt it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776011
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Really?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776012
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Well, think about it:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776013
    - rid: 4351268038788776014
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} said that this world was pretty accurate to the story of the original
      game.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776015
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: He also said that the original game didn't have the best writing.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Therefore, I believe it safe to assume that the other students are plot
      irrelevant while "off-screen."
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776016
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: And, as such, they are likely doing nothing at all while we're exploring
      the depths of these ruins.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776017
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You really are a smart girl, Yuri.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776018
    - rid: 4351268038788776019
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776020
    - rid: 4351268038788776021
    - rid: 4351268038788776022
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Ooh!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776023
    - rid: 4351268038788776024
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The two girls, upon seeing the strange magical thing before them, stop
      in their tracks.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hold on! Hold on! I thought it high time I caught up with you two-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268038788776025
    - rid: 4351268038788776026
    - rid: 4351268038788776027
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well now... would you look at that!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... why is this buried so far within Saarthal?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
